Summarize what changed for a service since a prior service generation

Usage:
  eshu freshness service-changed-since [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string               API key for authentication
  -h, --help                         help for service-changed-since
      --json                         Write the canonical service changed-since envelope as JSON
      --profile string               Config profile name
      --sample-limit int             Maximum sample handles per classification per family (max 200) (default 25)
      --scope-id string              Ingestion scope whose lineage of the service to diff; needed only when the service has a lineage in more than one readable scope
      --service-id string            Exact service id whose evidence lineage to diff (required)
      --service-url string           API service URL (overrides config)
      --since-generation-id string   Prior service materialization generation id to diff from (required)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
